      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.18,
          "end": 4.9,
          "en": "So let's get started with building our app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.9,
          "end": 6.68,
          "en": "and for this, let's first of all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.68,
          "end": 9.7,
          "en": "talk about configuring for production.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.7,
          "end": 11.74,
          "en": "So which kind of configuration settings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.74,
          "end": 15.6,
          "en": "might you wanna tweak before you build your app?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.6,
          "end": 19.05,
          "en": "Well, a very important topic are permissions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.05,
          "end": 20.47,
          "en": "Now, this of course depends",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.47,
          "end": 22.12,
          "en": "on the kind of app you're building,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.12,
          "end": 24.796,
          "en": "but if you are using certain device features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.796,
          "end": 27.942,
          "en": "like the camera or the user's location,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.942,
          "end": 30.74,
          "en": "then as you saw before in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.74,
          "end": 33.31,
          "en": "you might need to ask for permission,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.31,
          "end": 36.74,
          "en": "and therefore, you must make sure that you got the proper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.74,
          "end": 39.41,
          "en": "permission configuration set up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.41,
          "end": 42.06,
          "en": "Now, this depends on Android and iOS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.06,
          "end": 46.46,
          "en": "and it also depends on which package you are using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.46,
          "end": 49.35,
          "en": "to unlock certain native device features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.35,
          "end": 52.22,
          "en": "And I talked about permissions before in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.22,
          "end": 54.43,
          "en": "and in the previous course section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.43,
          "end": 57.95,
          "en": "I also show you what it means if you're not using Expo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.95,
          "end": 61.64,
          "en": "that you then might need to tweak the 'info.plist' file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.64,
          "end": 64.459,
          "en": "and the 'androidmanifest.XML' files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.459,
          "end": 67.82,
          "en": "in order to set up permissions there as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.82,
          "end": 69.89,
          "en": "So that is something to keep in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.89,
          "end": 73.253,
          "en": "And that is something you saw before in the course already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.57,
          "end": 76.93,
          "en": "Now, besides permissions, there also are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.93,
          "end": 80.19,
          "en": "a couple of other things that might need tweaking.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.19,
          "end": 84.01,
          "en": "For example, you might want to set an application name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.01,
          "end": 87.4,
          "en": "and unique identifier, which is then also used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.4,
          "end": 91.89,
          "en": "by the app stores once your app was submitted to them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.89,
          "end": 94.67,
          "en": "So you might want to set a visible app name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.67,
          "end": 97,
          "en": "so the name your users can see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97,
          "end": 98.78999999999999,
          "en": "and then this unique identifier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.78999999999999,
          "end": 100.91,
          "en": "and also give your app a version",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.91,
          "end": 103.28999999999999,
          "en": "so that if you would update it in the future,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.28999999999999,
          "end": 105.3,
          "en": "you could update the version as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.3,
          "end": 108.313,
          "en": "to show your users that the version changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.38,
          "end": 110.82,
          "en": "Your app might also be using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 113.11,
          "en": "environment variables or secrets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.11,
          "end": 116.21000000000001,
          "en": "and those can also be managed by Expo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.21000000000001,
          "end": 118.63,
          "en": "as you will see later in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.63,
          "end": 120.949,
          "en": "I will talk briefly about all these topics",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.949,
          "end": 122.513,
          "en": "in the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 123.49,
          "end": 126,
          "en": "Last but not least and also very important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 128.08,
          "en": "you typically of course also want to set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.08,
          "end": 130.67,
          "en": "your own icons or splash screens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.67,
          "end": 132.69,
          "en": "The splash screen is the loading screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.69,
          "end": 134.59,
          "en": "when your app is starting up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.59,
          "end": 138.14,
          "en": "and when using Expo you get an icon and a splash screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.14,
          "end": 139.14,
          "en": "out of the box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.14,
          "end": 140.54,
          "en": "But you might wanna bring your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 140.54,
          "end": 142.81,
          "en": "And therefore that of course is also something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 142.81,
          "end": 144.4,
          "en": "you typically want to configure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 144.4,
